1.2.0 2026-10-15
  - Added sourcedata/original_release/: the Brain Treebank release from
    https://braintreebank.dev/data/ byte for byte (37 files, 144.9 GB; zips not extracted),
    including the 26 per-trial HDF5 archives the BIDS runs were converted from.
    movie_frames.zip (film frames) is not included.
  - Added sourcedata/SOURCE_FILES.tsv and sourcedata/sourcedata_provenance.json (URL, size,
    SHA-256, MD5, retrieval time per file). The MD5 of every extracted HDF5 file matches the
    release's subject_data_hashes.zip.
  - README: new "Source data" section. .bidsignore: sourcedata/.
  - BIDS recordings and sidecars unchanged.
1.1.0 2026-09-21
  - Added BaRISTA spatial indices (barista_parcel_index, barista_lobe_index) to
    electrodes.tsv and electrodes.json.
1.0.0 2026-06-08
  - Initial release.
